The template-argument component of <a href="https://timsong-cpp.github.io/cppwp/n5050/defns.signature.spec">[defns.signature.spec]</a> and <a href="https://timsong-cpp.github.io/cppwp/n5050/defns.signature.member.spec">[defns.signature.member.spec]</a> already covers the invented count. We therefore need neither a signature change nor a separate pack-length component.

