A terminal abstract-declarator ellipsis then belongs to the parameter declaration under homogeneous-pack or existing ordinary expansion rules.

<aside class=issue>
<p><strong>Ian: wording. Jan: review. Eczbek: input.</strong> Check proposed reclamation grammar against trailing commas. Preserve standalone <code>...</code>, comma-separated C varargs, and ordinary pack expansions, including the comma between a pack expansion and following C varargs.</p>
</aside>

